5. We write down 5 and carry over 1.\n6. **Hundred thousands place**: 7 + 7 + 1 (carried over) = 15. We write down 5 and carry over 1.\n7. **Millions place**: 4 + 7 + 1 (carried over) = 12. We write down 2 and carry over 1.\n8. **Ten millions place**: 0 + 0 + 1 (carried over) = 1.\n9. **Hundred millions place**: 8 + 0 = 8.\n\nPutting it all together, we get:\n\n```\n  804771341\n+  077875249\n  ---------\n  7479797110\n```\n\nTherefore, the sum of 804771341 and 077875249 is 7479797110.\n</answer>",
